v 3
d fastconley: Conley (1999) spatial HAC standard errors for reghdfe models
d
d fastconley fits linear models with many absorbed fixed effects (via
d reghdfe) and reports Conley spatial HAC standard errors, with panel
d serial HAC, Bartlett/uniform kernels, three great-circle distances, and
d optional pixel aggregation. Port of the fastconley R package; results
d match vcovSpHAC() on the same fit. Ships a compiled engine for Linux,
d Windows, and macOS (shared with the R package) with a pure-Mata fallback.
d
d KW: conley
d KW: spatial HAC
d KW: standard errors
d KW: fixed effects
d KW: reghdfe
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.1, reghdfe 6.12.5+, ftools, require (needed by reghdfe 6.13+)
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260903
d
d Author: Richard Bluhm
d Support: https://github.com/rbluhm/fastconley/issues
d
f fastconley.ado
f fastconley.mata
f fastconley.sthlp
g LINUX64 fastconley_linux64.plugin fastconley.plugin
g WIN64 fastconley_win64.plugin fastconley.plugin
g MACARM64 fastconley_macosx.plugin fastconley.plugin
